<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Tomorrow’s sun may never rise</l><l>To bless thy long-deluded sight;</l><l>This is the time, O then be wise,</l><l>Be saved, O tonight.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Our Lord in pity lingers still,</l><l>And wilt thou thus His love requite?</l><l>Renounce at once thy stubborn will,</l><l>Be saved, O tonight.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Our blessed Lord refuses none</l><l>Who would to Him their souls unite;</l><l>Believe on Him, the work is done.</l><l>Be saved, O tonight.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
